["What did Mrs. Green give Aya?",["A new pet.","A small chair.","A book about rabbits.","A box of food."],2,"お礼にうさぎについての本をあげた。gave her a book about rabbits は「彼女にうさぎの本をあげた」。"],
["What does Aya want to do now?",["Go to another town.","Buy a bigger house.","Write a book for Mrs. Green.","Learn more about small animals."],3,"今は小動物についてもっと知りたい。Now she wants to learn more about small animals. が結末。アヤは世話の仕事を楽しんだ。"]
