["What did Lisa do before Ben cut the vegetables?",["She bought a pot.","She made some bread.","She washed the vegetables.","She went to the lake."],2,"リサはにんじんとじゃがいもを洗った。Lisa washed the carrots and potatoes, and Ben cut them. の順で分担している。"],
["Who helped Ben and Lisa make bread?",["Their mother.","Their teacher.","Their neighbor.","Their father."],3,"父がパン作りを手伝った。Their father came into the kitchen and helped them make bread. は「父が台所に来てパン作りを手伝った」。"],
 ["What did Ben and Lisa do in the afternoon?",["They took a short walk.","They rode their bikes to the lake.","They bought a cookbook.","They washed their bikes."],0,"午後は雨がやみ、自転車に乗る代わりに少し散歩した。took a short walk instead of riding their bikes の instead of は〜の代わりに。"]
